{"id":1691190,"shortDescription":"Rogue Waters es un rogue-lite táctico por turnos. Juega como el Capitán Cutter, al mando de tu barco y tripulación en encuentros generados proceduralmente para vengarte. Recluta, entrena y mejora a la tripulación, usa criaturas marinas y combate naval y cuerpo a cuerpo para ganar ventaja.","developers":["Ice Code Games"],"publishers":["Tripwire Presents"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"30 SEP 2024","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748339686","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691190/ss_7472d465beb366ddd539b5b61145f68b49a4b014.600x338.jpg?t=1748339686","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691190/ss_7472d465beb366ddd539b5b61145f68b49a4b014.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748339686"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691190/ss_352ffaa3c870b1db6161a16cd0c3ff1c243c360c.600x338.jpg?t=1748339686","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691190/ss_352ffaa3c870b1db6161a16cd0c3ff1c243c360c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748339686"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691190/ss_7cb8db4eb501ecf00f498b3a1dbb9d666c1b58cc.600x338.jpg?t=1748339686","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691190/ss_7cb8db4eb501ecf00f498b3a1dbb9d666c1b58cc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748339686"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691190/ss_8562557b74c48499cfc3b9a5a0ce79d44bb6e590.600x338.jpg?t=1748339686","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691190/ss_8562557b74c48499cfc3b9a5a0ce79d44bb6e590.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748339686"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691190/ss_dcd2c